WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:10.730
Toho Co., Ltd.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.950
Yomiuri TV's 60th Anniversary Production

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.700
Produced by
The "Detective Conan" Production Committee

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.700
Shogakukan, Inc.
Yomiuri Telecasting Corp.
Nippon Television Network Corp.
